---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Mamoru — App" description="Mamoru keeps your capital working while converting DeFi yield into stablecoins.">
  <main class="page">
    <div class="stack">
      <p class="badge" role="status">Demo / dry-run · Live LP HOLD</p>
      <header class="lockup">
        <img class="mark" src="/mark-two-stones.png" width="46" height="46" alt="Mamoru mark" />
        <p class="wordmark">Mamoru</p>
      </header>
      <h1 class="hero">APY.DELIVERED.</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">Mamoru keeps your capital working while converting DeFi yield into stablecoins.</p>
      <section class="beats" aria-label="How Mamoru works">
        <article class="beat">
          <h2>Connect</h2>
          <p>Connect your wallet in one click or log in with your email. Mamoru sets up a dedicated sub-account for your agent.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="beat">
          <h2>Fund</h2>
          <p>Deposit the ETH you want to put to work. The agent operates programmatically with that capital, leaving your main wallet untouched.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="beat">
          <h2>Harvest</h2>
          <p>Yield is automatically harvested from the pools, converted to USDC, and sent straight to the wallet of your choice.</p>
        </article>
      </section>
      <section class="lower">
        <h2 class="lower-title">DeFi yields you can actually spend</h2>
        <p class="lower-body">Stop endless autocompounding that leaves you with no real value. Mamoru captures raw DeFi yield, converts it to stablecoins, and sends it to your pocket while your principal works.</p>
      </section>
      <nav class="actions" aria-label="App entry">
        <a class="btn primary" href="/ops/app/onboarding">Launch APP</a>
        <a class="btn ghost" href="/ops/app/dashboard">Dashboard</a>
      </nav>
      <p class="links"><span>Github</span> <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> <span>X</span></p>
      <p class="note">Deposit and live LP stay off until gates are green.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Base>
<style>
  .page { min-height: 100dvh; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: flex-start; padding: clamp(1.25rem, 4vh, 3rem) clamp(1rem, 5vw, 4rem) 3rem; }
  .stack { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; text-align: center; width: 100%; max-width: min(40rem, 100%); gap: 0.85rem; }
  .badge { margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--emerald); border: 1px solid var(--wash); padding: 0.25rem 0.65rem; border-radius: 999px; }
  .lockup { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; }
  .mark { width: clamp(2.25rem, 3.4vw, 2.9rem); height: auto; display: block; }
  .wordmark { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 2vw, 1.55rem); }
  .hero { margin: 0.4rem 0 0; font-size: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 3.2rem); font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.05; }
  .subtitle { margin: 0; color: var(--stone); font-size: clamp(1rem, 2.2vw, 1.15rem); line-height: 1.45; max-width: 32rem; }
  .beats { width: 100%; display: grid; gap: 0.75rem; margin-top: 0.5rem; text-align: left; }
  .beat { border: 1px solid var(--wash); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--paper) 80%, transparent); padding: 0.9rem 1rem; }
  .beat h2 { margin: 0 0 0.35rem; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.78rem; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 400; }
  .beat p { margin: 0; line-height: 1.45; font-size: 0.98rem; }
  .lower { margin-top: 0.35rem; max-width: 32rem; }
  .lower-title { margin: 0 0 0.4rem; font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 1.6rem); font-weight: 400; }
  .lower-body { margin: 0; color: var(--stone); line-height: 1.45; }
  .actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem; justify-content: center; margin-top: 0.6rem; }
  .btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-width: 8.5rem; padding: 0.7rem 1.2rem; border-radius: 999px; text-decoration: none; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.85rem; letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .btn.primary { background: var(--ink); color: var(--rice); }
  .btn.ghost { border: 1px solid var(--wash); color: var(--ink); background: transparent; }
  .links { margin: 0.25rem 0 0; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--stone); }
  .note { margin: 0.5rem 0 0; color: var(--stone); font-size: 0.85rem; max-width: 28rem; }
</style>
